h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 224px\">\n<td style=\"width: 47.1418%;text-align: center;height: 10px\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Application Begin : <strong>01/09/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Last Date for Apply Online&nbsp; :&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b> <strong>30/09/2026 upto 05 PM</strong></b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Pay Fee Last Date : <strong>30/09/2026&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Last Date with Late Fees : <strong>07/10/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Correction Date : <strong>09-11 October 2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">RIMCEE 8th Stage I Exam Date 2026 : <strong>06/12/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Admit Card Available : <strong>05-07 Days</strong> <b>Before Exam</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Result Available Date : <strong>20/02/2027</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Stage II Viva Voce Schedule : April 2027</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 10px;width: 49.0502%\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Application Fees</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">General / OBC/ EWS : <b>1000/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">SC / ST : <b>750/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Late Fee : <strong>500/-</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / Online Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 96.192%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">RIMCEE Class 8th Admissions Notification 2027 : <span style=\"color: #008000\">Age Limit Details</span></span></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><b>January Term 2027 : </b>Age Limit: 12½ to 14 Years as on 01 January 2027.</li>\n<li><b>July Term 2027 : </b>Age Limit: 12½ to 14 Years as on 01 July 2027.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"height: 62px;width: 96.192%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">NTA RIMCEE 8th Admissions Notification 2027 :</span> <span style=\"color: #008000\">Admission Notification</span></b><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 28.2119%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"2\"><b>Class</b></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 18.9299%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"3\"><b>NTA RIMCEE Class 8th Eligibility 2027</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 85px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 10px;width: 28.2119%\" colspan=\"2\">NTA RIMCEE 8th Admissions</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 18.9299%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"3\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Appearing / Passed Class 7th exam from a recognized<br>\nSchool.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 96.192%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">NTA RIMCEE Class 8th Admission 2027 :</span> Document Required</span></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All the candidates will have to upload a photo, signature of themselves and their guardian.</li>\n<li>Aadhaar details/ Residence certificate Required.</li>\n<li>All types of certificates related to admission must also be uploaded.</li>\n<li>Example : Domicile Certificate / Left Hand Thumb Impression / Central Cast / Category / EWS / PH / ETC.</li>\n<li>Any Other Supporting Document Related to Admission.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"height: 25px;width: 96.192%\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>NTA Rashtriya Indian Military College Entrance Examination (RIMCEE) Class 8th Admissions are Released the Admission Notification Candidate Can Apply From <b>01/09/2026 to 30/09/2026</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Admission Section of Sarkari Result to Find Application Form in NTA Rashtriya Indian Military College Entrance Examination (RIMCEE) Class 8th Admissions Online Form 2027.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012)..</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 96.192%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidate Can Read the Full RIMCEE Class 8th Notification 2026 Before Apply Online.</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 96.192%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 47.1418%;height: 10px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"3\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 10px;text-align: center;width: 49.0502%\" colspan=\"2\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 96.192%;height: 25px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"Apply Online\" href=\"https://examinationservi