><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px;width: 49.0502%\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"NTA RIMCEE Official Website\" href=\"https://exams.nta.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>NTA RIMCEE Official Website</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<div>\n\n<!-- Internal_header_07-11-2024 -->\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"gb-headline-text\"><strong><em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">1. When did the NTA RIMCEE Class 8th Admissions 2027 start?</span></span></strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process for NTA RIMCEE Class 8th Admission 2027 started on <strong>01/09 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>2. What is the last date to apply online for National Testing Agency RIMCEE Class 8th Admission 2027?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to submit the online application form is <strong data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"634\">30/09/2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>3. What is the last date to Update application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">30/09/2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>4. When will the NTA RIMCEE Class 8th Admission Test 2027 Examination be conducted?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The examination will be conducted <strong>06 December 2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>5. What is the mode of the NTA Rashtriya Indian Military College Entrance Examination RIMCEE Class 8th Admissions 2027?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The NTA RIMCEE Class 8th application is submitted online, and the entrance exam is conducted <strong>offline</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>6. How can I apply for NTA RIMCEE Class 8th Admission Examination 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official Admission link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong></s